    "notes": [
      "Stats and portable copies implement the approved 2026-11-04 proposal. Native source sections are never changed.",
      "Private art copies preserve installed graphics and real foundation sizes, remove extra occupancy cells, and use installed role-appropriate cameos. Structures without native buildup appear when construction finishes; no invented buildup assets are referenced.",
      "Weather Crystal retains the Regenbogen graph and conventional-building immunity but disables EMEffect on its private warhead. Moving-aircraft behavior requires manual gameplay verification.",
      "Blackout Pulse is a separate paid, seven-minute building-provided timer; it does not grant the existing Blackout Missile reward or share that reward timer. Multiple stations share MOCBlackoutPulse.",
      "Psychic Beacon/Amplifier use finite reversible Controller warheads with native psionic immunity and no air/building targeting. Capacity is 9/32. No permanent or unlimited control is enabled.",
      "Hybrid support is restricted to the owned Hybrid family, range 6, 20% each, max four feeds/network members, no allied sharing. Runtime must translate PrismForwarding.Targets when compact clone IDs are used.",
      "Manual verification remains: placement/build/sell, cameos, Beacon/Amplifier capacity and control release, Hybrid feeds, Weather Crystal moving AA, and Blackout enemy-only EMP and charging/provider loss.",
      "Blackout impact animation uses private visual-only copies without the native animation-fired BlackoutB weapon; only the radius-8 private EMP warhead applies effects."
    ]
